<exercise data-wait-for-event="eventShowMore1">
  <problem>
    <para>4. Try to draw a tape diagram that represents 6÷0. Explain why this is so difficult.</para>
  </problem><solution>
    
    <!-- INSERT ANY VALID HTML HERE -->
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer: Your answer may vary, but here is a sample.</para>
    <para>The zero takes up no space, so no matter how many copies we have it could never reach 6.</para>
